Demonbane *only* works on demons, though.  It is very rare to
encounter any demons until below the Castle and even then under
half of all monsters aren't demons.  Thus Demonbane is far
too specialized to be of much use most of the time.

Compare that with Stormbringer that drains levels from almost
all monsters on all levels and all monsters on most levels.

Excalibur's additional damage is against all mosnters.

Mjollnir gives added damage to all monsters not shock
resistant so basically the shallower you go the better it
works.

Frost Brand does double damage against all monsters that are
not cold resistant and cold resistance gets less common as
you get deeper after some point.

Bascially Frost Brand's advantages start at the top and keep
on applying unlike Demonbane's advantages that don't exist
at all until very deep.

> We leave out Grayswandir, a fine weapon but not so good for a valkyrie.

Don't ignore it if there is any chance of getting it.  Its
double damage applies to all monsters at all levels and that
is better than any other artifact's special function.  If
you get Greyswandir the only weapon that compares is Frost
Brand and Grayswandir does not break potions.

> In the beginning, Excalibur is not to hard to get, with luck and 
